# Playing quests (Q6): the player swears into the Watch's career, waits at the oath when a
# fine sets them back, and moves on through the odd jobs, closing the one left over. Every
# number is worked out by hand in PLAN.md's Q6.

load content/sample
can-start player watch_captain
start player watch_oath
choose player watch_oath report
assert standing player city_watch == 19.50

# Fined, they fall below the 10.00 the oath needs, and wait there until they've made it up.
outcome fined_by_watch player
assert choose player watch_oath swear == error: player can't choose at watch_oath.oath yet: it needs standing 10.00 with city_watch, and player has -0.50
act player report_crime
act player report_crime
act player report_crime
assert standing player city_watch == 14.50
choose player watch_oath swear

# Two of the three odd jobs complete the step; starting a favour closes the third.
start player night_patrol
choose player night_patrol by_the_book
start player dock_inspection
choose player dock_inspection seize
start player harbour_errands
can-start player smugglers_cove
progress player
